    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/7ac5b42251c1471b22ae0029a99776e6.webp?t=1748981145\" width=616 height=38 /></span>Midnight Mayhem features some complex mechanics. If you're looking for something quick and casual, this may not be the game for you.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/37fc38f26b63cde1d0c10797a6a8a9d3.webp?t=1748981145\" width=616 height=38 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/4b97299712202698de56e12b8f50e5a3.poster.avif?t=1748981145\" width=616 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/4b97299712202698de56e12b8f50e5a3.webm?t=1748981145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>Be prepared for anything as the monsters abilities keep evolving and changing!</strong><br>The monster player has limited control over their next ability so they will also have to think quickly to make the best use of them!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/00f457fdab5d52eee7ba5cd9af6326cc.webp?t=1748981145\" width=616 height=38 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/fea64ec865cee5f2942f005184a8108f.poster.avif?t=1748981145\" width=616 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/fea64ec865cee5f2942f005184a8108f.webm?t=1748981145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>Hide in the shadows and kill your prey one by one!</strong><br>Stalk your prey from a distance and stay as close as possible without being seen. Then strike before they have time to react!<br><br>You're completely invisible in the shadows. Avoid light at all cost!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/73c88342d25d2fd93c929160c37a7953.webp?t=1748981145\" width=616 height=38 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/4c3244fd82ff496e88dc7ea066bf14d7.poster.avif?t=1748981145\" width=616 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/4c3244fd82ff496e88dc7ea066bf14d7.webm?t=1748981145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>Use various improvised weapons and gadgets to locate and defend from the monster. </strong><br>Use the right tool at the right time to shift the tides!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/db6faf43ea852cd19a4fbd19fa133f04.webp?t=1748981145\" width=616 height=38 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/19e6d048548e3904c6fab0a7461e8a92.poster.avif?t=1748981145\" width=616 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/19e6d048548e3904c6fab0a7461e8a92.webm?t=1748981145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>Work together to survive and banish the monster once and for all!</strong><br>Don't forget to check the shadows and keep a light source close by, once it decides to attack it's already too late!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/82ed87b979400c047c73f9804187a24a.webp?t=1748981145\" width=616 height=38 /></span>Work with your friends or try to brutally murder them!<br><br>The game supports proximity chat with other effects like echo in certain locations.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/02a1f91137143a257892271a6aa6a15f.webp?t=1748981145\" width=616 height=38 /></span>Join the Discord using the button on the right side of the page!<br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Proximity chat<br></li><li>2-6 players<br></li><li>18 Strange monster abilities<br></li><li>4 Different maps<br></li><li>5 Main weapons<br></li><li>6 Different gadgets and tools<br></li><li>4 Modulators to switch up the gameplay<br></li><li>11 Unlockable masks to customize your character<br></li><li>6 Emotes<br></li><li>Xbox controller support</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/7ac5b42251c1471b22ae0029a99776e6.webp?t=1748981145\" width=616 height=38 /></span>Midnight Mayhem features some complex mechanics. If you're looking for something quick and casual, this may not be the game for you.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/37fc38f26b63cde1d0c10797a6a8a9d3.webp?t=1748981145\" width=616 height=38 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/4b97299712202698de56e12b8f50e5a3.poster.avif?t=1748981145\" width=616 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/4b97299712202698de56e12b8f50e5a3.webm?t=1748981145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>Be prepared for anything as the monsters abilities keep evolving and changing!</strong><br>The monster player has limited control over their next ability so they will also have to think quickly to make the best use of them!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/00f457fdab5d52eee7ba5cd9af6326cc.webp?t=1748981145\" width=616 height=38 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/fea64ec865cee5f2942f005184a8108f.poster.avif?t=1748981145\" width=616 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/fea64ec865cee5f2942f005184a8108f.webm?t=1748981145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\">